Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.14,0:00:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,As we all travel across the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.62,0:00:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Raising our voices we take\Nin the beautiful blue world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.94,0:00:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Our spirits ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.84,0:00:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody rejoices.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.62,0:00:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's go get the sails all unfurled!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.76,0:00:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,La la la la la!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.06,0:00:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah yeah yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.68,0:00:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we are in between\Nthe sea and the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.42,0:00:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready now for adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.28,0:00:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We're itching to try!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.92,0:00:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready to roam!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.52,0:00:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,So all aboard now we're said to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.94,0:00:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Set sail to the ocean so deep!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.08,0:00:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready for a truly grand adventure!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.30,0:00:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Well don't you think\Nthat sounds really fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.80,0:00:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,All this excitement is second to none!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.20,0:00:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,As we all travel across the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.98,0:00:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Raising our voices we take.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.06,0:00:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,In the beautiful blue world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.32,0:00:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Our spirits ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.18,0:00:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody rejoices.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.92,0:01:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's go get the sales all unfurled!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.78,0:01:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,La la la la la!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.38,0:01:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.08,0:01:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's something that\NI just won't ever forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.68,0:01:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the way that I felt\Nwhen our journey was set.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.26,0:01:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I won't be scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.86,0:01:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I keep that feeling there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.18,0:01:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,With that, let us keep up the pace!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.44,0:01:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,While enjoying every\Ntrip from place to place!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.04,0:01:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Our timid hearts get the rhythm ingrained!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.12,0:01:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's keep going, adventure awaits!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.58,0:01:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So many treasures await!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.88,0:01:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So now let's raise our voices in pride!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.40,0:01:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Laughing out when they are found!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.72,0:01:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,With all the riches in\Nhand, everybody rejoices!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.30,0:01:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Party on, cause we stand tall and proud!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.68,0:01:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Life is adventurous, be\Naware it's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.04,0:01:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's gonna be one of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.20,0:01:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And a trip goes on because.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.44,0:01:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the pirates of the mass.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.22,0:01:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,To the west, to the east.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.98,0:02:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta find my way, sail away,\Nall the way to one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.78,0:02:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring all your dreams with\Nyou, now fill the void.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.26,0:02:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,In your heart, spread your wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.92,0:02:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And believe that you can soar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.14,0:02:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let the breeze guide the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.04,0:02:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Till you're ready to start up once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.58,0:02:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're ready for more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.70,0:02:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So many treasures away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.60,0:02:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So now let's raise our voices in pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.14,0:02:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Laughing out when they are found.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.26,0:02:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,With all the riches in hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.30,0:02:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody rejoices, party on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.82,0:02:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause we stand tall and proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.82,0:02:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The doctor home?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.52,0:03:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What if no one lives here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.74,0:03:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Beats the zombies.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.04,0:03:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I say we give it a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.16,0:03:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The lights just turned on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.92,0:03:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a good sign, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.84,0:03:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But why would they shine a\Nspotlight on this old well?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.96,0:03:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.96,0:03:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome. Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.78,0:03:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, three.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.74,0:03:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And four, five
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.02,0:03:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This crazy woman is throwing plates!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.62,0:03:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Six, seven Why are you only attacking me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.16,0:03:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.78,0:03:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you alone are not\Nallowed to enter the mansion?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.42,0:03:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You two are just fine, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.54,0:03:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, I'm confused?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.10,0:03:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you, get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.30,0:03:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Eight, nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.26,0:03:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.44,0:03:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it, that's enough! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.46,0:03:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Please nothing scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.82,0:03:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh hope he doesn't throw plates?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.64,0:04:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We can make an exception just\Nthis once, can't we, Shandora?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.62,0:04:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me if we startled you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.46,0:04:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You must excuse her, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.30,0:04:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,She was once engaged to a wealthy man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.46,0:04:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But to test his love, she shot her\Ntemplates from his cherished dining set.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.10,0:04:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Sadly, he then called off the engagement.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.36,0:04:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Cast out of her home in disgrace.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.28,0:04:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,She has become my personal servant\Nwith a boundless plate grudge.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.70,0:04:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I don't really care.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.84,0:04:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And as you may have already surmised, I\Nam the long-missing world-famous surgeon,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.62,0:04:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Dr. Hawkback.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.68,0:04:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,A genius in the eyes of\Nmany. Fool! Ted! Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.52,0:04:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Shandora!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.58,0:04:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We went over this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.88,0:04:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I said he could come inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.46,0:04:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,When you don't listen to me, then I\Nlook like a fool in front of our guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.42,0:04:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish every last plate in\Nthis world would disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.96,0:04:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.87,0:04:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.34,0:04:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I just got done\Nexplaining it, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.88,0:04:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper, that's who\Nyou were talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.46,0:04:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.37,0:04:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hogback, it's really him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.32,0:04:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't look like a genius to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.02,0:04:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.18,0:05:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make an exception this once.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.34,0:05:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All three of you may enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.56,0:05:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll continue our conversation inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.00,0:05:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.91,0:05:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, there you have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.22,0:05:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Please make yourselves a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.50,0:05:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I still don't get why she\Nhated me so much, but whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.32,0:05:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess at least we get to go in now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.14,0:05:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.05,0:05:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything's better than that creepy forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.40,0:05:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, hey, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.46,0:05:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.60,0:05:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quite rare for me to receive\Nguests, but my, you certainly are filthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.60,0:05:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it a stressful trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.22,0:05:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, yes, but it's sort\Nof a long story. We, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.48,0:05:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.39,0:05:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I can talk to him about\Ndoctor stuff later.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.60,0:05:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We were attacked by a bunch\Nof zombies in the forest?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.88,0:05:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So we ran away and came\Nhere to take shelter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.52,0:05:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Zombies, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.52,0:05:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We also saw a bunch of crazy\Nmonsters that were straight out
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.00,0:05:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,of a horror story What the heck\Nis up with this creepy island?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.42,0:05:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, you live here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.82,0:06:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta know something So these\Nbeasts were chasing you, were they?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.20,0:06:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet you still made\Nit here in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.30,0:06:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite impressive!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.64,0:06:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But to answer your question.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.66,0:06:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know much about\Nthose creatures either.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.02,0:06:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Which is precisely why I'm here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.08,0:06:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you mean you're studying zombies?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.44,0:06:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a brand new realm of medical research
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.90,0:06:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.82,0:06:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Although most people\Nassociate zombies with fear,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.90,0:06:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,what if you think of them in terms of\Nsomeone who has come back from the dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.78,0:06:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it's a miracle!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.14,0:06:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The dream of all doctors!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.16,0:06:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone in this world has a loved one\Nthey'd like to see come back to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.30,0:06:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, that's human nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.92,0:06:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet the medical community condemns it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.72,0:06:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Madness, they call it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.92,0:06:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to blame God. They say.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.84,0:06:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I disappeared from society,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.58,0:06:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,so I could continue my research in seclusion\Non this island without interruption.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.68,0:06:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.00,0:06:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So I finally found out the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.82,0:06:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But just think, if your\Nresearch here is a success,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.28,0:06:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,then you're going to bring happiness to\Nthousands of people all over the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.94,0:06:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,As a doctor myself, sir,\NI'm behind you all the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.48,0:07:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How open-minded.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.00,0:07:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, thank you, Dr. Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.36,0:07:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you acknowledge me as a doctor,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.04,0:07:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,you won't get on my good\Nside, you big dummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.24,0:07:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Could I have your autograph?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.98,0:07:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.40,0:07:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,to my dear Dr. Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.22,0:07:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So do you think you could give me\Na little tour of your lab later?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.56,0:07:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,No one, and I mean no one,\Ncan look inside my lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.32,0:07:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.23,0:07:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on here, Century!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.18,0:07:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you at least put\Nthe flan on a plate?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.18,0:07:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that too much to ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.34,0:07:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish every last plate in\Nthis world would disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.78,0:07:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, this sort of thing\Ndoes tend to happen,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.34,0:07:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,so rest assured, I'm always quite adamant\Nabout keeping the tablecloth clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.76,0:07:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll eat then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.48,0:07:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You could still use a spoon, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.02,0:07:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so sweet, I love it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.06,0:07:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I've prepared a bath for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.86,0:08:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you're all filthy, you should\Ntake one before you go to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.44,0:08:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost forgot to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.18,0:08:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There's someone else who came\Nto this island before us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.58,0:08:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This may sound crazy, but have you\Nseen a skeleton roaming around today?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.18,0:08:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,A skeleton?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.52,0:08:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he had an afro and he was in\Na really good mood for a dead guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.44,0:08:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Course,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.35,0:08:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,even for this place,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.50,0:08:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it'd still be weird to see a\Nskeleton walking around and talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.64,0:08:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're sure he didn't come by?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.20,0:08:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Never seen him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.72,0:08:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.08,0:08:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.24,0:08:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it really him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.28,0:08:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it couldn't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.32,0:08:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I shouldn't, but\NI want to take a peek.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.92,0:08:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What? You do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.32,0:08:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper, I'm shocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.64,0:08:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not talking about Nami's\Nbutt, you silly human.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.56,0:08:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The thing I want to take a peek at is Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.98,0:08:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hogback's awesome laboratory.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.80,0:08:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.74,0:09:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's probably haunted.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.20,0:09:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do we have to sit out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.64,0:09:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, Nami, if you're that afraid\Nto take a shower by your lonesome,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.58,0:09:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you should skip it all together.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.56,0:09:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe some of us don't want to smell\Nlike zombies any longer than we have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.62,0:09:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Stinky butts.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.53,0:09:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.45,0:09:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,How would you know what\Nour butts smell like?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.14,0:09:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.05,0:09:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as nighttime\Nhits, we're out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.68,0:09:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.68,0:09:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,At night?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.59,0:09:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's scary enough during the day!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.36,0:09:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We finally found a place where\Nnobody's trying to eat us,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.48,0:09:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,but as soon as we step outside,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.14,0:09:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,we're the main course\Nin a Straw Hat buffet!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.30,0:09:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds painful, so for the time\Nbeing, I'm staying right where I am,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.78,0:09:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,all we gotta do is wait\Nfor Luffy to show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.02,0:09:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll save us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.00,0:09:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I think He's right, mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.08,0:09:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This island's way too creepy for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.18,0:09:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going through\Nthat graveyard again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.68,0:09:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not any safer inside than out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.82,0:09:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You did take a look at\Nthis mansion, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.62,0:09:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If my hunch about this place is correct,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.84,0:09:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,we are right in the\Nmiddle of spook central.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.82,0:09:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There are more zombies in this\Nmansion than you can shake a stick at.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.00,0:10:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Get me out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.94,0:10:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I need my brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.08,0:10:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The one I'm worried about is Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.22,0:10:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hogback himself he's lying to us there's\Nno doubt about it if he really has Nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.24,0:10:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,to do with the zombies on this island then
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.46,0:10:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,you tell me why they\Nleave his place alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.44,0:10:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And terrorize everything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.12,0:10:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what do you think\Nwe should do, Chopper?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.48,0:10:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If what she's saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.84,0:10:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,is true no way is she saying that Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.04,0:10:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hogback is working with the zombies that's\Nwhy we're gonna make our escape while
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.96,0:10:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,we still have the chance when I'm finished\Nhere we make a break For the coast.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.96,0:10:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You are a very observant woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.38,0:10:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.29,0:10:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Usopp, Chopper, what did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.72,0:10:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.62,0:10:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But my butt just did.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.74,0:10:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you should call me Pusopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.32,0:11:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.28,0:11:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,There isn't anybody in here, is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.18,0:11:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.72,0:11:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You're even prettier than\Nthe last on the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.72,0:11:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Fear looks so good on you. Who said that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.00,0:11:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's up, Chopper?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.18,0:11:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hush, my darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.56,0:11:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Or should I say, my bride.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.06,0:11:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you just now call for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.66,0:11:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet you could smell his\Nfight in here too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.34,0:11:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.58,0:11:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you thanking her?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.46,0:11:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, damn them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.34,0:11:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.08,0:11:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.62,0:11:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Save me already!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.08,0:11:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.40,0:11:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I can smell it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.12,0:11:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.54,0:11:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not talking about\Nyour fire, it's a person!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.42,0:11:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.58,0:11:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He's escaping out the window!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.44,0:11:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Great, now I have to shoot\Nat an invisible target?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.90,0:12:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Special attack, gunpowder, star!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.36,0:12:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But he must have escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.52,0:12:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, whoever it was, they heard it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.04,0:12:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, who heard what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.34,0:12:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I still don't understand all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.68,0:12:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure it wasn't my fart?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.42,0:12:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He was in here the entire time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.06,0:12:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,An invisible man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.52,0:12:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, this is no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.10,0:12:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to this gigantic spider\Nweb, we're dead in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.20,0:12:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, no pun intended.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.74,0:12:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if meeting that skeleton was a fluke,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.12,0:12:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,the fact that the Thousand\NSunny and the Mini Mary both got
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.24,0:12:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,tangled up in this web in the exact\Nsame spot is pretty damn fishy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.84,0:12:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody went to a hell\Nof a lot of trouble
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.84,0:12:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,to make sure that when\Nwe enter this place,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.84,0:12:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,it's through the front\Ngate and nowhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.80,0:12:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.71,0:12:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,if they were going to\Nmake it that obvious,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.96,0:12:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,they might as well have laid\Nout a welcome mat for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.40,0:12:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Nero, what are you\Nmumbling about up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.80,0:12:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to miss all the fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.04,0:12:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you seriously about to walk\Ninto a trap that's so damn obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.74,0:13:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,One even a headless zombie would\Nhave the sense to run away from?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.98,0:13:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty much, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.20,0:13:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like we have anything\Nbetter to do right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.74,0:13:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.80,0:13:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't go, then\NI'm taking your lunchbox.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.10,0:13:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is there suddenly a\Nstaircase leading down?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.90,0:13:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the only way in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.10,0:13:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just go with the plug.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.38,0:13:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I wonder if these\Nskeletons can poop too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.46,0:13:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Check it out, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.76,0:13:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Cerberus.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.76,0:13:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We're literally on the\Npath to hell right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.30,0:13:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, I think it's kind of cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.06,0:13:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they a threat?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.98,0:13:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm feeling super.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.86,0:13:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Three heads are overkill.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.40,0:13:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Blender with a teeth like.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.24,0:13:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Weird how they got all\Nriled up out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.20,0:13:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.28,0:13:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-uh. Dips.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.08,0:14:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to tame this bad boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.74,0:14:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiot, you can't just tame it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.26,0:14:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You do know it's not a regular dog, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.22,0:14:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,How different can it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.84,0:14:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, who's a good boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.24,0:14:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Shake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.12,0:14:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I assume we all saw this moment coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.84,0:14:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What big, strong teeth you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.44,0:14:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let go of Uncle Luffy's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.88,0:14:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a good boy's.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.58,0:14:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Easy does it, just like I said. No, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.58,0:14:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Roll over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.54,0:14:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That just happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.46,0:14:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The poor thing's body\Nlooks pretty beat up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.22,0:14:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised it can still\Nwalk around like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.62,0:14:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what wise-ass put this thing\Ntogether, because whoever it was,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.12,0:14:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,they can't tell the difference\Nbetween a dog head and a fox head.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.66,0:14:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If this is the first creature\Nwe met on the island,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.10,0:14:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see what\Nother stuff we run into.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.86,0:14:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Cerberus seems pretty down in the mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.04,0:15:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.98,0:15:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't pity him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.89,0:15:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It just makes him feel worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.12,0:15:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave him alone already.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.03,0:15:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me, Nami Sweet?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.50,0:15:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.02,0:15:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you, my feisty truffle?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.08,0:15:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm all turned around.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.56,0:15:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like a maze full of creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.18,0:15:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.36,0:15:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,A tree with some geezer's face is totally\Ngetting drunk with a beat-up unicorn!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.54,0:15:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Look what I got!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.34,0:15:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, just let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.92,0:15:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They're so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.30,0:15:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,How about you join my pirate crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.76,0:15:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Overruled, dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.92,0:15:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That was too close.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.82,0:15:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You're there, right, Absalom?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.60,0:16:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I can never tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.70,0:16:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What was all that ruckus?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.00,0:16:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you peeking in on\Na bathing beauty again?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.90,0:16:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on the hunt for a bride, Hogback.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.52,0:16:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The redhead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.00,0:16:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I quite fancy her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.30,0:16:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make her mine soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.28,0:16:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate to burst your bubble, but you\Nshouldn't go marrying the Golden Goose.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.68,0:16:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.26,0:16:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We have six guests with bounties\Non their heads this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.32,0:16:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,including that girl you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.98,0:16:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Her captain's worth 300 million berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.66,0:16:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,300 million?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.46,0:16:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't seem very worried, Verona.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.90,0:16:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If his bounty is that high, we can\Nonly assume he's one tough customer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.38,0:16:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If you understand that, then you'll\Nknow you have to go all out on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.34,0:16:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And that means no chasing skirts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.60,0:16:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like we'll have\Nourselves a busy night tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.78,0:16:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Invisible men don't exist, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.58,0:16:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,End of discussion.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.49,0:17:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't imagine it, you ninny.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.30,0:17:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,When you came in there, you saw how it\Nwas holding me off the ground, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.70,0:17:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.61,0:17:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, uh, sorry, Nami. Didn't\Nsee a thing. Don't lie to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.94,0:17:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, trick question.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.14,0:17:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That's no fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.05,0:17:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as I confess to seeing\Nyou naked, I'm done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.02,0:17:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna slap me into next week!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.78,0:17:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.69,0:17:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not trying to play mind games here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.62,0:17:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The slapping can wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.76,0:17:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,See? I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.90,0:17:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanna know what I think?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.40,0:17:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing I've seen on this island has\Nbeen real, including you being naked.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.76,0:17:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The Invisible Man was just a draft.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.94,0:17:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The ghosts were weird birds.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.74,0:17:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And the zombies were just\Nsome underground tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.44,0:17:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you nuts? Sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.92,0:17:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,we ran into a fiddle-playing\Nskeleton with an
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.90,0:17:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,afro who was brought back\Nto life by Devil Fruit,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.34,0:17:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,but he was the exception.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.44,0:17:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No two devil fruits in\Nthe world work the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.28,0:17:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If his fruit brought him back\Nto life, then he's the only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.22,0:17:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So zombies and ghosts and all the other\Nhorrible stuff around here is impossible,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.04,0:17:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,right, Chopper?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.76,0:17:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.86,0:17:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, back me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.28,0:17:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The creatures we saw,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.74,0:17:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no natural explanation\Nfor them, so they can't be real.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.02,0:18:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're looking at this from a medical\Npoint of view, then you're correct, Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.98,0:18:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There should be an explanation\Nfor all this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.28,0:18:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Then again, if Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.92,0:18:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hogback thought his work on the island was
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.64,0:18:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,important enough to leave\Nhis whole life behind,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.56,0:18:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,maybe the natural order of things has\Nturned upside down on this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.68,0:18:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That is not what I wanted to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.80,0:18:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe Hogback's not the\Nhero you think he is. Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.02,0:18:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hogback is an amazing\Nman and a medical titan!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.72,0:18:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he's incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.14,0:18:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,How come you think the worst of him?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.86,0:18:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't know if he's\Nfriends with those zombies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.88,0:18:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't prove anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.10,0:18:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.01,0:18:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's go ask Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.48,0:18:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hogback what he thinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.98,0:18:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,How's that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.78,0:18:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.88,0:18:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish Luffy would hurry up and save us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.08,0:18:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I don't have anything to base it\Non yet, but I don't trust that Hogback.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.48,0:18:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,He gives me the creeps.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.34,0:19:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't this the room we just ate dinner in?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.44,0:19:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, so how come it's pitch\Nblack in here? What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.60,0:19:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, Shandora, you around? Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.84,0:19:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hogback, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.96,0:19:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we're done with the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.02,0:19:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid the doctor and Shandora\Nhave called it a day. Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.00,0:19:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hildon?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.91,0:19:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, you little,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.83,0:19:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,what's the big idea ditching our carriage\Nin the middle of a scary graveyard?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.00,0:19:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel bad about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.68,0:19:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of nowhere, I really\Nhad to go to the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.38,0:19:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You know how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.66,0:19:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're such a liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.78,0:19:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Admit it, weirdo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.76,0:19:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in cahoots with those zombies.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.18,0:19:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you say such awful\Nthings about poor Hildon?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.56,0:19:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But enough of that unpleasantness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.66,0:19:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If you'll follow me to the guest rooms...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.84,0:20:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So if you don't turn us into Zombie\NChow at first, try, try again?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.22,0:20:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't trust you any farther\Nthan I can throw you, Pudgy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.72,0:20:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,FYI, we're leaving here right now, and\Nthere's nothing you can do about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.42,0:20:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.84,0:20:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let me trade things out with Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.68,0:20:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hogback!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.24,0:20:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you bungled it, Hildon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.10,0:20:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to be so mean to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.36,0:20:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take them up to their rooms, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.78,0:20:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's a little late for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.52,0:20:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,These three have noticed\Nfar too much around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.92,0:20:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't risk them\Ntelling anyone about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.10,0:20:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.78,0:20:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The painting!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.28,0:20:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's holding the conversation\Nwith us like it's people!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.72,0:20:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so cute, I can\Nswallow you whole right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.26,0:20:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go of him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.88,0:20:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The painting's trying to eat Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.52,0:20:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to be a seller!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.94,0:20:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Get your butt over here and help!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.52,0:20:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Oral Support!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.16,0:21:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It is not the painting that you have to\Nworry about, but I, the Great Orchuk.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.74,0:21:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You fools will never leave this room alive\Nagain, so just get that out of your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.92,0:21:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That mounted pig head on\Nthe wall is talking too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.70,0:21:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And it threw a sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.26,0:21:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're busy, Nami, but there's a\Npretty threatening taxidermy back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.34,0:21:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.54,0:21:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.22,0:21:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, who's the wise guy\Nwho stabbed the bear skin?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.78,0:21:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami was right!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.90,0:21:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This mansion is wall-to-wall zombies!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.66,0:21:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the decorations!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.44,0:21:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.00,0:21:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.26,0:21:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat this, you freaky undead frog!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.98,0:21:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you threw a candle at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.62,0:21:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously, who does that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.12,0:22:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We've gotta find him!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.06,0:22:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The guy on the chandelier did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.80,0:22:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Throw the candles in him,\Nsee how much he likes it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.22,0:22:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no you don't, because I know your\Nweakness, foul minions of the underworld!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.48,0:22:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The power of Usopp compels you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.36,0:22:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami, Chopper, open the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.44,0:22:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.22,0:22:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care about Dr. Hogback!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.38,0:22:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.88,0:22:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Open it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.79,0:22:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart can't take much more of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.36,0:22:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.98,0:22:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.32,0:22:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.50,0:22:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We're really trapped in here, Usof!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.02,0:22:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you set me on fire,\Nyou dumb little Pierre!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.06,0:22:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not getting away that easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.38,0:23:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.50,0:23:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That was way too close!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.12,0:23:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta get to a different room!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.62,0:23:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything beats this!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.08,0:23:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.90,0:23:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.28,0:23:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't the way out!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.72,0:23:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a fireplace!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.32,0:23:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.32,0:23:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nowhere else to run! Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.06,0:23:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the heck are we?\NDamn it! What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.64,0:23:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,They disappeared all\Nof a sudden! Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.42,0:23:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a secret passageway\Nbehind the fireplace.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.82,0:23:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't catch them,\Nthey're going to make it to Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.92,0:23:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hogback's research lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.10,0:24:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no good!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.44,0:24:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,They must be blocking\Nit from the other side!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.64,0:24:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Run and run wherever\Nyou like, little humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.22,0:24:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll find that the mansion is full\Nof surprise zombies at every turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.68,0:24:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This hallway is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.20,0:24:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Any place with paintings is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.00,0:24:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,There's gotta be a room in here somewhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.64,0:24:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.56,0:24:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, they're just photos.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.28,0:24:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No zombies.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.06,0:24:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.92,0:24:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.10,0:24:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's that girl from before.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.04,0:25:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The one who hates plates so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.00,0:25:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Shandora.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.70,0:25:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.80,0:25:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this room?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.96,0:25:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I get a better look,\Nshe's really pretty, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.02,0:25:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,She sure doesn't look\Nlike a servant, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.40,0:25:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.44,0:25:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't think this\Nplace is her room, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.98,0:25:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That'd be a little odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.76,0:25:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, who would have so many photos\Nof themselves in their own room?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.08,0:25:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What about all those\Nbig stitches she's got?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.94,0:25:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,They aren't in any of the photos.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.74,0:25:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.84,0:25:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And look at that smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.20,0:25:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,She's like a completely different\Nperson than the one we met.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.96,0:25:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe these are old photos\Nand she had some accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.70,0:25:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's got to be her.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.56,0:25:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Victoria Shandora. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.12,0:25:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Evidently, she used to be\Na really popular actress.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.52,0:25:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.78,0:25:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,All these articles are about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.36,0:25:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.36,0:25:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,She was an actress?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.58,0:26:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought they said she got into trouble
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.34,0:26:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,for breaking a bunch\Nof plates or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.36,0:26:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,So you mean she wasn't\Na servant after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.16,0:26:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,On the contrary, this says she\Ncame from an aristocratic family.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.86,0:26:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,She had a successful career on the stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.76,0:26:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And even as a child,\Nshe had a lot of fans.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.74,0:26:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.64,0:26:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,These articles are old.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.68,0:26:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten years ago, she fell from the\Nstage and died in an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.76,0:26:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't be right!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.24,0:26:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We saw her ourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.48,0:26:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, she is kind of creepy,\Nbut she's definitely alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.12,0:26:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.03,0:26:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So if what that article\Nsays is true after all,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.02,0:26:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,she must have come back from the dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.10,0:26:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no other answer!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.32,0:26:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,All those zombies we saw weren't\Nsome kind of weird monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.30,0:26:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They were people and animals who had\Ndied and been brought back to life!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.32,0:27:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like this at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.16,0:27:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even want to\Nthink about it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.42,0:27:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just forget we ever\Ncame here and run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.70,0:27:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.34,0:27:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.42,0:27:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that what I think it is? It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.92,0:27:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a treasure chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.36,0:27:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Better already?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.42,0:27:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what are you waiting for, Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.28,0:27:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Open it up, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.98,0:27:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.12,0:27:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, suckers, but there's\Nno treasure in this room!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.76,0:27:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.42,0:27:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.14,0:27:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, zombies!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.04,0:28:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He said there was no\Ntreasure in that room.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.12,0:28:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,They must be hiding\Nsomething somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.78,0:28:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.80,0:28:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the bodyguard.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.30,0:28:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems some lost lambs have\Nwandered into the mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.38,0:28:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're just in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.18,0:28:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But never fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.80,0:28:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall herd them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.56,0:28:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,For the last time, Luffy,\Nthe skeleton was bad enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.76,0:28:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't need trees and\Nunicorns on the crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.30,0:28:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, look, we've already\Ngot a raccoon dog and a robot.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.08,0:28:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That's messed up enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.99,0:28:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, how many times do I got to tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.94,0:28:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not a robot.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.85,0:28:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a cyborg.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.78,0:28:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.70,0:28:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, you're not human.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.04,0:28:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,In my heart, I'm a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.22,0:28:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.36,0:28:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,In your heart, you're a pervert, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.56,0:28:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, then you understand after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.88,0:28:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that was not a compliment.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.46,0:29:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of monsters are we gonna see?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.44,0:29:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope they join the crew\Nand come along with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.06,0:29:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something I\Ncouldn't help but notice
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.12,0:29:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,about that tree man and\Nthe unicorn earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.60,0:29:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.72,0:29:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like our doggy friend here,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.60,0:29:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,all of the creatures in this\Nforest seem to have heavy injuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.20,0:29:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Big stitches and numbers written on them\Nsomewhere, numbers, huh? That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.60,0:29:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't put much thought into\Nit myself But are you saying
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.16,0:29:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,these things are all working\Nfor someone something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.12,0:29:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.46,0:29:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey guys, you hear those noises?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.92,0:29:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.22,0:29:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Negative, negative, negative.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.13,0:30:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Kind of annoying how they keep\Nsaying negative over and over.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.74,0:30:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to catch it\Nand keep it as a pick!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.70,0:30:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like it really is a ghost, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.70,0:30:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.62,0:30:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Red Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.28,0:30:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.42,0:30:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess that didn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.30,0:30:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I totally suck.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.96,0:30:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything I did this week totally sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.34,0:30:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything I've ever done totally sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.40,0:30:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I might as well lie down and die.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.88,0:30:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This should make me into a ceiling fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.58,0:30:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So your attack didn't work!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.72,0:30:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be a baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.88,0:30:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.52,0:30:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.04,0:30:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be reincarnated as a clam.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.12,0:30:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't cut it as a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.34,0:30:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.32,0:30:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Just leave me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.12,0:30:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Get over it already!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.48,0:30:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.70,0:30:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Negative.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.90,0:30:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Negative, negative.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.56,0:31:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It would appear that when the\Nghosts pass through someone's body,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.62,0:31:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,they become depressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.74,0:31:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And how does that make any sense?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.56,0:31:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Those two are just straight-up pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.74,0:31:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If they had even an ounce\Nof proper discipline,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.90,0:31:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,they wouldn't let themselves\Nfall to pieces over
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.00,0:31:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,some measly little ghost\Nbarely even touching them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.80,0:31:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not even fit to be dog food.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.02,0:31:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.60,0:31:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.22,0:31:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Though it looks like Robin's\Ntheory turned out to be spot on.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.44,0:31:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,None of our attacks can harm them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.24,0:31:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But if they pass through our\Nbodies, we'll be rendered helpless.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.74,0:31:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,They might prove troublesome\Nif we have to fight them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.78,0:31:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.32,0:31:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What a strange island?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.52,0:31:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Negative, negative, negative, negative.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.02,0:31:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.18,0:31:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw you, ghost!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.26,0:31:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to have you as a pet anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.86,0:31:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to crush you!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.62,0:31:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever their weak\Npoint is, I'll find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.84,0:31:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Just you wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.80,0:32:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I should call you dog food. Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.92,0:32:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The patchwork creatures with the\Nnumbers on them may look frightening,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.78,0:32:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,but they seem easy enough to defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.24,0:32:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The ghosts, on the other hand,\Nseem to be exactly the opposite.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.92,0:32:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,There was one of them on the ship earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.72,0:32:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,They show up, then vanish.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.60,0:32:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems to me like they're watching us.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.60,0:32:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's the case, the question\Nis, who's pulling the strings?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.72,0:32:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.54,0:32:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a giant graveyard!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.84,0:32:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.75,0:32:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect place for a picnic,\Ndon't you think? No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.86,0:32:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This atmosphere will ruin the taste!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.34,0:33:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't put me back\Non the ground, jackass!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.50,0:33:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an old man with serious injuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.26,0:33:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.40,0:33:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a zombie!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.12,0:33:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make fun of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.90,0:33:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Are zombies usually this... energetic?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.32,0:33:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you how dangerous\Nzombies can really be!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.28,0:33:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you guys want to fight, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.40,0:33:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll show you how\Ndangerous pirates can be!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.64,0:34:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what are all you\Nguys doing out here, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.18,0:34:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, zombie stuff mostly, you know, being\Nburied, hanging out, rotting and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.56,0:34:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, pretty much rotting and hanging out.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.52,0:34:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.44,0:34:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not lying to me, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.90,0:34:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No, really, that's the truth, we swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.12,0:34:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Zombie stuff, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.70,0:34:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.24,0:34:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let me ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.20,0:34:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Did a man with a long nose,\Na woman with orange hair,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.86,0:34:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,and a reindeer that looks like\Na raccoon dog come through here?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.96,0:34:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, right, right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.94,0:34:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We may have seen them, but\Nwe're not supposed to...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.02,0:34:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, we can't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.18,0:34:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oilers, oilers, oilers, oilers, oilers.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.48,0:34:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.62,0:34:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're not going to tell me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.08,0:34:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, yeah, we saw them.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.86,0:34:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Those guys are part of my crew. Listen up,\Nyou didn't do anything to them, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.84,0:35:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, they're on your crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.84,0:35:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we didn't, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.50,0:35:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, we did nothing at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.94,0:35:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I want the truth right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.10,0:35:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy did something.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.86,0:35:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, shut up, Tattletail!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.22,0:35:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And anyway, you're the one that bit them.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.98,0:35:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, we all did.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.64,0:35:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiots, shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.68,0:35:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw you fight those zombies.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.78,0:35:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,All of you have such\Nunbelievable strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.64,0:35:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something I'd\Nlike to talk to you about
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.92,0:35:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,would you please listen old\Nman with serious Injuries
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.16,0:35:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,idiot we told you they're\Nzombies oh actually he's
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.88,0:36:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,right on the money that's\Ntoo Confusing can't you
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.92,0:36:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,just be a zombie geez all\Nright so what did you want
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.24,0:36:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,To tell us, there's an evil\Nman who must be brought.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.00,0:36:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,down and I think you\Nyoungsters are strong enough
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.92,0:36:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,To do it. He's left a trail\Nof victims in his wake.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.14,0:36:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,If you defeat him, they'll all be rescued.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.90,0:36:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,If you'd help me get my shadow\Nback, I'd be ever so grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.58,0:36:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.72,0:36:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true. See?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.06,0:36:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He really doesn't have a shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.50,0:36:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just like Brook.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.70,0:36:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, damn, that sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.36,0:36:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So who did that to you? Is he here?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.84,0:36:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Somewhere on this island?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.60,0:36:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Mor... Moria.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.96,0:36:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,His name is Moria, and he's terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.30,0:36:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Moria?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.21,0:36:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.34,0:36:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Gecko Moria by any chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.58,0:36:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.96,0:36:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.32,0:36:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin, do you know this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.30,0:37:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but only by name.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.68,0:37:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And if I remember correctly, his former\Nbounty was even higher than yours, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.94,0:37:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait. Former?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.52,0:37:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So that means...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.64,0:37:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.55,0:37:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Gekkomoria is one of the\Nseven warlords of the sea.
